<section class="pawpath pawpath__section pawpath__section--sand">
  <div class="pawpath__container pawpath__container--narrow">
    <p class="pawpath__eyebrow">FAQ</p>
    <h1 class="pawpath__heading pawpath__heading--section">Questions before you order.</h1>
    <p class="pawpath__lead">Clear answers about shipping, returns, and our products.</p>
    <div class="pawpath__faq" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item" open>
        <summary>Where do you ship?</summary>
        <p>We ship throughout the United States. International shipping is not available at this time.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item">
        <summary>How long does shipping take?</summary>
        <p>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Most US deliveries arrive within 3–7 business days after processing. You'll receive tracking information by email once your order ships.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item">
        <summary>Do you offer free shipping?</summary>
        <p>Yes — free standard shipping on all US orders over $50.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item">
        <summary>What is your return policy?</summary>
        <p>Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery. For hygiene and safety, used pet products cannot be accepted. Contact us at our <a href="/pages/contact">contact page</a> to start a return.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item">
        <summary>Are slow feeders or enrichment products medical devices?</summary>
        <p>No. Slow feeders, lick mats, and snuffle mats are designed for supervised routine enrichment. They are not medical devices and should not replace advice from your veterinarian.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pawpath__faq-item">
        <summary>What size dogs are your products for?</summary>
        <p>Most PawPath gear is designed for small through large breeds. Check individual product pages for specific size and weight guidance.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PawPath FAQ page",
  "presets": [{ "name": "PawPath FAQ page" }]
}
{% endschema %}
